# Cost Centre Performance Dashboard

## 📝 Project Overview

This Power BI dashboard visualizes expense performance by cost centre, department, and time period. It supports drill-through and filtering to analyze detailed cost drivers.

## 🔧 Tools & Skills Used
- Power BI
- Data modeling and DAX measures
- Visual storytelling
- Drill-through and filters

## 📈 Key Features
- Expense breakdown by cost centre and GL account
- Trend analysis over time
- Department-level filtering and drill-through reports
- KPI cards for key metrics (variance, actual, budget)

## 💡 Business Insight

The dashboard provides transparency into departmental costs, supporting accountability and more informed financial management.
